          "end": 5496.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Barakat:",
          "start": 5496.82,
          "end": 5496.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SHAHADA is witness. So, word SHAHADA means witness.",
