          "speaker": "Abdullah"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 5496.82,
          "end": 5496.82,
          "speaker": "Abdullah"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The believers are recognized, the righteous people are recognized by the,",
