        {
          "word": " Wise.",
          "start": 5496.82,
          "end": 5496.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Sabahi"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[3:127]  He thus annihilates some disbelievers, or neutralizes them; so they end up in failure.",
      "start": 5496.82,
      "end": 5496.82,
      "speaker": "Dr. Sabahi",
      "words": [
